  dct:description "Vygruppen AS aims to enter a parallel framework agreement with up to 3 suppliers for the production and delivery of signs and foil for Vygruppens's vehicles and buildings. By vehicle is mainly meant trains. Deliveries will mainly take place in Norway, but deliveries to other Nordic countries may also be relevant."@en;
